  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1306.02 Applying for a Temporary License. To apply for a temporary license under RSA 328-J:13, the applicant shall proceed in accordance with Plc 305 or Plc 306, as applicable.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
